# ============================================================
# ET_Mini_Militia — Git ignore policy
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# reference/ : extracted/decompiled contents of the commercial
#              Mini Militia XAPK. Copyrighted material — never
#              redistribute. Kept local for study only.
# tools/     : third-party binaries & multi-hundred-MB editor
#              downloads (apktool.jar, jadx, CocosCreator zip).
# ============================================================

# --- copyrighted reference material (never publish) ---
reference/

# --- heavy toolchain binaries ---
tools/*
!tools/tsc-check/
!tools/fetch-creator.ps1

# --- Cocos Creator generated working files ---
game/temp/
game/library/
game/build/
game/local/
game/profiles/
game/extensions/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log

# --- archives ---
*.zip
*.xapk
*.apk
